WEBVTT

01:41.530 --> 01:46.000
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.580 --> 01:48.830
[Episode 14]

01:49.050 --> 01:51.350
[Grand Hall]

01:52.000 --> 01:53.280
The Guardian has gone down the mountain for business.

01:53.920 --> 01:55.000
Has he already left?

01:55.710 --> 01:57.150
Didn't we just get guests?

01:57.479 --> 01:58.759
I even made some delicious food.

02:06.930 --> 02:08.600
He said we should go down the mountain for experience

02:08.630 --> 02:09.520
and accumulate merits.

02:09.960 --> 02:11.030
But where exactly should we go?

02:11.110 --> 02:12.720
Master left without giving any instructions.

02:14.590 --> 02:15.100
Ranran,

02:15.360 --> 02:16.590
where do you think we should go?

02:18.360 --> 02:19.360
No way,

02:20.090 --> 02:21.250
direct disciples

02:21.280 --> 02:23.000
can't just be all show and no substance.

02:23.960 --> 02:25.310
Don't you have any plans in mind?

02:29.030 --> 02:29.630
How about we go to a place

02:29.630 --> 02:30.590
with beautiful scenery?

02:31.470 --> 02:33.120
The other day, the Paired Wings Auspicious Cloud

02:33.150 --> 02:34.590
was in the sky from morning until noon.

02:35.000 --> 02:35.840
It was so beautiful.

02:36.630 --> 02:38.079
Let's go to a place with such beautiful scenery.

02:38.520 --> 02:39.430
The Paired Wings Auspicious Cloud?

02:40.650 --> 02:41.930
Didn't it only appear for a moment

02:41.960 --> 02:43.150
before being covered by other clouds?

02:43.310 --> 02:43.870
Not at all.

02:44.190 --> 02:45.720
I specially brought over a chair

02:45.750 --> 02:47.240
and watched it outside for half a day.

02:48.000 --> 02:48.840
You saw it too?

02:49.360 --> 02:49.870
Yes.

02:51.190 --> 02:53.400
The auspicious clouds from the other day were so big,

02:53.430 --> 02:54.960
just like a pair of birds flying wing to wing.

02:55.520 --> 02:57.079
Many lovers must've

02:57.240 --> 02:58.800
confessed their love successfully under those clouds.

03:01.000 --> 03:02.800
Why did I see something different?

03:03.190 --> 03:03.750
Unless

03:04.240 --> 03:05.760
someone used a Smokescreen on you.

03:06.480 --> 03:07.090
But on our mountain,

03:07.120 --> 03:07.910
there are only a few of us.

03:08.360 --> 03:09.800
Who would use such tactics on you?

03:10.800 --> 03:13.360
You must have seen it wrong yourself.

03:16.120 --> 03:17.960
Could it be that Master noticed

03:17.960 --> 03:19.310
my feelings for him

03:19.800 --> 03:21.360
and deliberately wanted to discourage me?

03:23.310 --> 03:23.710
Ranran,

03:23.910 --> 03:24.840
why are you so jumpy?

03:25.150 --> 03:25.520
I...

03:25.910 --> 03:26.700
I'm tired of sitting.

03:27.560 --> 03:28.310
I'll take a walk.

03:35.660 --> 03:36.470
If

03:36.750 --> 03:38.430
Master is deliberately avoiding me...

03:41.470 --> 03:43.310
Then that time when the rocks collapsed,

03:43.840 --> 03:45.750
the sword energy that protected me must have been from Master.

03:47.000 --> 03:48.880
Ever since I was affected by the Peach Blossom Intoxication last time,

03:49.910 --> 03:51.630
Master has been avoiding me for so long.

03:52.310 --> 03:53.590
He didn't even show up to save me

03:54.090 --> 03:55.630
and deliberately covered up the auspicious clouds.

03:56.590 --> 03:57.400
Paired Wings Auspicious Cloud,

03:57.630 --> 03:58.560
please listen to my wish.

03:58.960 --> 04:00.030
With Master, I hope...

04:02.470 --> 04:03.870
What does this mean?

04:08.150 --> 04:09.080
It means...

04:10.960 --> 04:11.800
Did Master

04:12.430 --> 04:14.240
lose his focus too?

04:15.870 --> 04:16.680
It must be so.

04:17.390 --> 04:19.240
It seems I wasn't the only one who lost composure last time.

04:19.600 --> 04:20.390
Master did too.

04:21.920 --> 04:24.750
Even the Unfeeling Mantra can be shaken.

04:25.630 --> 04:26.720
Learn from this lesson.

04:27.950 --> 04:28.870
Next time, I absolutely can't

04:28.870 --> 04:29.750
be so impulsive

04:30.560 --> 04:32.110
to avoid scaring Master away again.

04:34.000 --> 04:34.600
Xue Ranran,

04:34.920 --> 04:35.500
keep up the effort!

04:35.720 --> 04:36.600
You still have a chance!

04:37.430 --> 04:38.120
Ranran.

04:40.560 --> 04:41.400
Why are you

04:41.430 --> 04:42.390
hiding over there laughing?

04:46.390 --> 04:47.310
Of course I'm happy to go down

04:47.750 --> 04:49.050
the mountain for experience and good deeds!

04:55.070 --> 04:56.270
As you ordered,

04:56.950 --> 04:59.430
I will make sure Xue Ranran and Su Yishui

04:59.720 --> 05:00.870
get entangled with each other.

05:01.720 --> 05:02.430
This way,

05:03.120 --> 05:05.310
we can discover the whereabouts of the Spirit Spring.

05:15.120 --> 05:15.870
May I ask if you are

05:16.360 --> 05:17.510
the Immortal Masters from Mount Wester?

05:18.070 --> 05:18.630
Indeed, we are.

05:19.160 --> 05:19.800
That's wonderful!

05:20.050 --> 05:21.010
We've been waiting for Immortal Masters

05:21.040 --> 05:22.040
to come down from Mount Wester.

05:22.430 --> 05:23.240
Recently,

05:23.850 --> 05:24.530
there have been soldiers

05:24.560 --> 05:25.680
dying in the river where I fish.

05:26.240 --> 05:26.750
Moreover,

05:27.310 --> 05:28.360
their deaths are mysterious.

05:28.870 --> 05:30.510
I beg you, Immortal Masters, to investigate.

05:30.800 --> 05:31.870
I hope it's not some kind of

05:32.360 --> 05:33.390
evil creature harming people.

05:34.040 --> 05:35.510
We were just looking for a place to gain experience.

05:36.040 --> 05:36.560
What a coincidence!

05:37.980 --> 05:38.820
Sir, where is

05:38.980 --> 05:40.180
this fishing spot?

05:40.680 --> 05:41.480
Wangxiang Pass.

05:41.590 --> 05:42.270
We got it.

05:42.430 --> 05:43.240
We will definitely go there.

05:43.920 --> 05:45.270
Thank you very much, Immortal Masters.

05:47.190 --> 05:47.870
There's hope now!

05:48.390 --> 05:49.159
There's hope now!

05:50.240 --> 05:52.310
But to investigate the soldiers' deaths,

05:52.330 --> 05:53.130
we need to enter the camp.

05:54.159 --> 05:54.920
However, we can't

05:54.950 --> 05:55.720
just enter the military camp

05:55.750 --> 05:56.630
without a reason.

05:56.830 --> 05:57.950
How does the Wangxiang Pass camp

05:57.950 --> 05:59.040
have such strange occurrences?

05:59.190 --> 05:59.870
We were just about to

05:59.870 --> 06:00.680
go there to entertain the troops.

06:01.120 --> 06:01.630
That's right!

06:02.160 --> 06:03.310
We four illusionists

06:03.360 --> 06:04.480
have prepared some amazing tricks.

06:04.560 --> 06:04.920
Yes, indeed.

06:04.940 --> 06:06.240
We were hoping to earn some extra money.

06:06.720 --> 06:07.720
Now with these strange events,

06:08.110 --> 06:08.950
should we still go?

06:09.270 --> 06:09.750
Yes,

06:09.770 --> 06:10.600
troupe leader, should we still go?

06:10.630 --> 06:11.630
Yes, should we still go?

06:12.560 --> 06:14.040
This couldn't have worked out better.

06:24.680 --> 06:25.680
You've been staring

06:25.680 --> 06:26.630
at this compass for a while now.

06:27.950 --> 06:29.070
What's the situation?

06:32.150 --> 06:32.750
Su Yishui,

06:32.870 --> 06:33.800
I'm talking to you.

06:33.830 --> 06:34.680
Where are you going?

06:34.830 --> 06:35.920
There's a demonic aura on the compass.

06:36.270 --> 06:37.560
I need to consult the Earth Immortal of this area.

06:45.000 --> 06:45.560
Ranran,

06:46.270 --> 06:48.040
we're going to disguise ourselves as illusionists to enter the military camp.

06:48.310 --> 06:49.240
Won't we be exposed?

06:50.240 --> 06:51.159
Soldiers are disappearing.

06:51.190 --> 06:53.040
The officers fear it will demoralize the troops, so they're keeping it quiet.

06:53.190 --> 06:53.840
This is our only way

06:53.870 --> 06:54.920
to continue the investigation.

06:55.159 --> 06:55.560
Don't worry.

06:55.830 --> 06:56.150
It'll be fine.

06:56.360 --> 06:56.720
Let's go.

06:58.040 --> 06:58.390
Let's go.

07:05.630 --> 07:07.390
This is the morgue?

07:07.930 --> 07:09.900
Why are there so many salted fish here?

07:10.890 --> 07:12.210
Are we in the wrong place?

07:12.950 --> 07:14.800
They need to hide the bodies of the newly deceased soldiers.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.510
Naturally, they use salted fish to mask the smell.

07:16.980 --> 07:17.550
This is the place.

07:17.630 --> 07:17.980
Let's go.

07:37.950 --> 07:40.070
The corpses have turned pale from being soaked in water.

07:40.580 --> 07:42.310
They have such large holes in their stomachs.

07:42.600 --> 07:43.800
It must be the work of evil sorcery.

07:46.860 --> 07:47.450
Here.

08:07.480 --> 08:08.270
There's a demonic aura.

08:08.680 --> 08:09.870
So it's the work of a demon.

08:10.510 --> 08:11.800
What good does knowing all this do?

08:12.270 --> 08:13.600
Anything can turn into a demon.

08:14.240 --> 08:15.830
We still have no leads to investigate.

08:16.830 --> 08:17.920
I have a way to see that demon.

08:26.130 --> 08:27.280
Using the Seeing Sunflower

08:27.310 --> 08:29.000
to trace what the corpse saw before death.

08:29.160 --> 08:30.360
Ranran, you're really something.

09:19.790 --> 09:20.480
I saw it.

09:20.790 --> 09:21.870
The deceased was being controlled

09:21.870 --> 09:22.750
and walked towards the riverbank.

09:23.080 --> 09:24.200
There really was a demon behind him.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.120
That monster

09:27.710 --> 09:28.910
was completely black,

09:29.200 --> 09:30.170
shaped like a tiger or leopard.

09:30.650 --> 09:31.510
Senior Gao Cang,

09:31.880 --> 09:33.550
your hometown is not far from Wangxiang Pass.

09:33.720 --> 09:35.010
Are there such fierce beasts here?

09:35.670 --> 09:36.960
Wangxiang Pass

09:37.550 --> 09:39.270
had many casualties after the great battle of Fan Yao.

09:39.600 --> 09:41.320
The netherworld opened up over a decade ago

09:41.670 --> 09:42.630
and evil energy invaded again.

09:42.960 --> 09:44.720
Add to that the years of border warfare,

09:45.250 --> 09:45.880
and a death zone formed

09:45.910 --> 09:47.030
not far from here.

09:47.480 --> 09:48.360
Death zone?

09:49.030 --> 09:49.390
Yes,

09:50.080 --> 09:51.550
it's a valley filled with corpses.

09:51.870 --> 09:52.670
It's very sinister.

09:53.360 --> 09:54.750
The entire Wangxiang Pass has become

09:55.080 --> 09:55.960
barren of birds and beasts along with it.

09:56.440 --> 09:57.510
Livestock can hardly survive.

09:57.960 --> 09:59.360
There aren't even any wild game to catch.

10:00.080 --> 10:01.550
Fortunately, there are plenty of fish in the river.

10:01.970 --> 10:03.090
So if the nearby residents

10:03.120 --> 10:03.870
want to eat meat,

10:03.960 --> 10:04.840
they can only eat fish.

10:05.270 --> 10:07.150
I'm certain that the huge beast you mentioned

10:08.030 --> 10:09.360
can't exist here.

10:11.600 --> 10:12.600
That beast

10:13.050 --> 10:14.290
had one yellow eye

10:14.320 --> 10:15.270
and one blue eye.

10:15.630 --> 10:16.660
If not a fierce beast,

10:17.840 --> 10:18.910
it seemed more like...

10:19.120 --> 10:19.550
A cat?

10:21.680 --> 10:22.450
Perhaps that demon

10:22.480 --> 10:23.510
is hiding in the military camp.

10:24.240 --> 10:25.120
Let's split up and look around.

10:25.320 --> 10:25.910
There must be some clues.

10:26.320 --> 10:27.000
-Okay.
-Okay.

10:52.510 --> 10:53.390
I use my blood

10:53.670 --> 10:54.840
to summon the Earth Immortal of this place.

10:55.200 --> 10:55.730
Come to me!

10:56.750 --> 10:59.440
Who dares to summon me?

11:01.990 --> 11:02.590
It's you!

11:08.080 --> 11:08.600
Over there.

11:08.870 --> 11:10.230
Such a powerful earth energy fluctuation.

11:10.600 --> 11:11.560
In the military camp,

11:11.790 --> 11:13.030
there's suddenly such a strong disturbance.

11:13.480 --> 11:14.260
It must be that demon.

11:14.790 --> 11:15.240
Let's go.

11:18.800 --> 11:19.480
Quick, follow me.

11:19.630 --> 11:20.550
There's a demon in the camp.

11:21.020 --> 11:21.810
Aren't you

11:21.840 --> 11:23.320
the illusionists invited to entertain the troops?

11:23.600 --> 11:24.720
I'll explain later.

11:24.840 --> 11:25.870
Come with me to catch the demon.

11:26.080 --> 11:26.480
Hurry.

11:26.870 --> 11:27.240
Let's go.

11:29.270 --> 11:29.840
Follow me.

11:34.480 --> 11:35.030
You, you, you...

11:35.440 --> 11:36.530
More than a decade ago,

11:36.720 --> 11:37.960
you stole the playmate I found

11:38.510 --> 11:39.480
and that damned girl

11:40.060 --> 11:41.630
forced me to lose 300 years of cultivation.

11:41.840 --> 11:43.200
Now you have the nerve to summon me?

11:44.720 --> 11:46.120
There are evil spirits running rampant here.

11:46.630 --> 11:47.630
According to Heavenly rules,

11:48.000 --> 11:48.720
as a cultivator,

11:48.750 --> 11:50.120
I can summon the Earth Immortal of this place to inquire.

11:50.270 --> 11:50.960
I'm not listening.

11:50.980 --> 11:51.790
I don't care to listen.

11:53.000 --> 11:54.270
I sacrificed a drop of my essence blood

11:54.390 --> 11:55.320
to set up this Spirit Dispelling Formation.

11:55.670 --> 11:57.000
It's precisely to deal with uncooperative ones like you.

11:57.870 --> 11:58.670
Since that's the case,

11:58.910 --> 12:00.000
I'll send you to the subordinate position.

12:00.120 --> 12:00.870
I'll take the main position

12:01.100 --> 12:02.720
and then command you to follow me to find the demon.

12:02.750 --> 12:03.630
You have no choice but to obey.

12:05.600 --> 12:06.150
How dare you!

12:06.360 --> 12:07.000
Shameless!

12:17.030 --> 12:18.030
What demon is it?

12:20.430 --> 12:21.580
M-Master!

12:34.790 --> 12:35.320
Silly girl!

12:35.480 --> 12:36.080
You're here too?

12:36.320 --> 12:37.030
I'll leave

12:37.270 --> 12:38.470
this Spirit Dispelling Formation for you two to play with.

12:38.770 --> 12:39.270
Goodbye.

12:41.550 --> 12:42.390
This strange and ghostly thing

12:42.670 --> 12:43.480
is indeed a demon.

12:44.390 --> 12:45.630
And it's a pretty boy demon at that.

12:46.390 --> 12:46.840
Catch him!

12:47.400 --> 12:47.940
It's a misunderstanding.

12:48.080 --> 12:48.870
A misunderstanding!

12:50.360 --> 12:50.910
Young lady,

12:51.270 --> 12:52.320
weren't you the one who wanted to catch demons?

12:53.050 --> 12:53.600
This...

12:54.750 --> 12:56.000
This is a warm-up act.

12:56.550 --> 12:57.400
This gentleman here

12:57.490 --> 12:58.090
is our

12:58.120 --> 12:59.270
most famous illusionist.

12:59.650 --> 13:00.970
What everyone just saw

13:01.000 --> 13:02.240
was his warm-up trick.

13:04.960 --> 13:05.630
That's right, that's right.

13:05.840 --> 13:07.270
Everyone, please wait a bit for the main show.

13:08.480 --> 13:09.510
Put away your swords first.

13:13.550 --> 13:14.630
She already said it was a warm-up.

13:15.510 --> 13:16.150
Disperse now.

13:17.030 --> 13:17.750
Yes.

13:21.870 --> 13:23.080
You are disciples from Mount Wester?

13:24.750 --> 13:25.110
Yes.

13:25.630 --> 13:26.600
May I ask who you are?

13:28.000 --> 13:28.790
Qin Xuanjiu.

13:30.360 --> 13:31.670
You're the one our founder

13:31.670 --> 13:32.600
took as her last disciple.

13:33.010 --> 13:34.120
Greetings, Mr. Qin.

13:35.440 --> 13:36.960
So you're Su Yishui's disciples.

13:37.910 --> 13:38.840
As expected, you're causing trouble.

13:39.130 --> 13:39.970
You're playing tricks

13:40.000 --> 13:40.750
to sneak into my military camp.

13:41.200 --> 13:41.980
What are you up to?

13:42.670 --> 13:43.670
Aren't there soldiers in the camp

13:43.670 --> 13:44.720
who died mysteriously?

13:44.980 --> 13:46.000
We came down the mountain to gain experience

13:46.030 --> 13:47.080
and happened to investigate this case.

13:47.510 --> 13:49.120
I've tried so hard to conceal this matter.

13:49.750 --> 13:50.720
How did you find out about it?

13:51.670 --> 13:52.590
Evil spirits hide well,

13:52.790 --> 13:54.150
so of course we had to inquire carefully.

13:57.360 --> 13:58.450
I detected

13:58.480 --> 13:59.530
a trace of demonic aura on the corpses.

14:01.840 --> 14:02.510
There's no need to investigate.

14:03.080 --> 14:04.080
Go somewhere else for your training.

14:04.440 --> 14:05.120
Leave immediately.

14:06.150 --> 14:07.630
Why not investigate such a strange occurrence?

14:07.910 --> 14:09.030
Why do we need to go elsewhere,

14:09.030 --> 14:09.510
Master?

14:10.860 --> 14:11.930
Since when do I

14:11.960 --> 14:12.750
need to explain myself to you?

14:13.240 --> 14:13.720
Still not leaving?

14:14.440 --> 14:14.870
We're not leaving.

14:15.390 --> 14:16.910
Master, you can't just make me leave like this.

14:17.240 --> 14:17.700
Is that so?

14:22.240 --> 14:23.000
Master?

14:26.790 --> 14:27.600
Give me some water.

14:31.960 --> 14:32.720
Xue Ranran!

14:33.280 --> 14:34.990
The Spirit Dispelling Formation

14:35.550 --> 14:36.720
had the positions of master and subordinate reversed.

14:37.720 --> 14:38.690
I stepped on the master's position

14:38.720 --> 14:39.840
and you stepped on the subordinate's position,

14:40.840 --> 14:41.510
didn't you?

14:41.870 --> 14:42.240
Yes.

14:42.840 --> 14:43.630
No more questions.

14:44.840 --> 14:45.540
Master,

14:45.600 --> 14:46.620
this isn't my fault.

14:46.670 --> 14:48.090
Since things have come to this,

14:48.360 --> 14:49.000
I want to investigate the case

14:49.030 --> 14:49.870
and you can't drive me away,

14:50.000 --> 14:50.480
so

14:50.840 --> 14:51.720
you have no choice but to let me stay

14:51.750 --> 14:52.390
by your side.

14:53.960 --> 14:55.240
You're an interesting little girl.

14:55.600 --> 14:56.270
Stay here then.

14:57.670 --> 14:59.440
Seeing Su Yishui at a loss

15:00.240 --> 15:02.150
really makes me feel good.

15:05.720 --> 15:06.390
However,

15:07.760 --> 15:08.880
when I asked Su Yishui earlier

15:08.910 --> 15:09.720
about the compass,

15:10.670 --> 15:11.600
he mentioned demonic aura.

15:11.960 --> 15:13.120
You also detected demonic aura, didn't you?

15:14.480 --> 15:15.600
What kind of demonic aura

15:15.600 --> 15:16.440
did you detect?

15:29.790 --> 15:31.240
Is the demon that killed the soldiers

15:31.840 --> 15:32.790
the same one

15:32.790 --> 15:33.750
that broke the compass?

15:35.030 --> 15:35.630
Mr. Qin,

15:36.120 --> 15:37.200
do you have any cats in your camp?

15:37.720 --> 15:38.270
There is one.

15:38.630 --> 15:39.360
A stray I found.

15:39.720 --> 15:40.360
It's wild in nature,

15:41.200 --> 15:42.620
but Coal is thin and weak.

15:42.720 --> 15:43.710
It's nothing like a demon.

15:44.050 --> 15:45.390
Then are there scratches

15:45.440 --> 15:46.080
on your arm?

15:48.630 --> 15:49.440
Coal scratched me.

15:50.510 --> 15:50.960
What's the matter?

15:52.180 --> 15:53.540
Now this is interesting.

15:54.240 --> 15:54.790
Ranran!

15:56.870 --> 15:57.720
-Master.
-Master.

15:58.960 --> 15:59.980
Let's talk about this later.

16:00.720 --> 16:01.440
It seems we really

16:01.440 --> 16:02.390
need to perform some illusions now.

16:13.890 --> 16:14.640
It was them just now

16:14.670 --> 16:15.580
who warmed up the crowd with illusions.

16:15.670 --> 16:16.360
It was quite a sight.

16:17.510 --> 16:18.600
We're waiting for

16:18.840 --> 16:19.550
your main performance now.

16:20.750 --> 16:21.360
Mr. Qin.

16:21.750 --> 16:22.120
This...

16:23.100 --> 16:24.720
The commotion just now was too big.

16:25.390 --> 16:26.630
I can't cover this up.

16:27.030 --> 16:27.670
You guys,

16:28.030 --> 16:29.440
figure out how to deal with it yourselves.

16:31.120 --> 16:31.960
I'm going to watch the main show.

16:35.790 --> 16:36.440
Ranran.

16:36.630 --> 16:37.630
What should we do now?

16:42.630 --> 16:43.310
I have an idea.

16:44.310 --> 16:45.190
Gentlemen,

16:45.210 --> 16:46.130
want to see some magic tricks?

16:46.910 --> 16:47.320
Easy.

16:48.030 --> 16:49.510
However, for the next performance,

16:49.790 --> 16:51.030
I'll need your cooperation.

16:51.480 --> 16:52.380
As long as it's good,

16:52.640 --> 16:53.880
we're willing to do whatever

16:53.910 --> 16:54.670
you want us to do.

16:54.870 --> 16:55.440
Right?

16:55.550 --> 16:57.030
Yes, yes, yes.

16:57.200 --> 16:57.840
Everyone,

16:57.940 --> 16:59.260
raise your hands high.

17:02.320 --> 17:03.240
What's this?

17:04.550 --> 17:05.750
Let's just do as she says. Then what?

17:05.750 --> 17:06.200
Like this.

17:06.270 --> 17:06.750
Raise it up.

17:06.880 --> 17:07.270
Like this?

17:07.349 --> 17:07.790
We've raised them.

17:07.960 --> 17:08.920
Why are you making us raise our hands?

17:08.920 --> 17:09.270
Yeah.

17:09.290 --> 17:09.980
Don't tell me

17:10.200 --> 17:10.880
it's to catch an embroidered ball

17:10.950 --> 17:11.619
for matchmaking?

17:14.020 --> 17:14.940
Don't be impatient.

17:15.240 --> 17:16.069
This performance

17:16.349 --> 17:17.319
guarantees that all of you

17:17.349 --> 17:19.000
will have good luck in love.

17:20.310 --> 17:21.349
Really?

17:21.589 --> 17:24.109
Great!

17:25.150 --> 17:25.990
I can't wait anymore.

17:38.430 --> 17:39.260
How magical!

17:39.830 --> 17:40.750
There really are peach blossoms.

17:41.720 --> 17:42.520
Yes, it's beautiful.

17:42.550 --> 17:43.110
It's true.

17:43.310 --> 17:43.800
These peach blossoms.

17:43.830 --> 17:44.650
are getting bigger!

17:44.680 --> 17:45.260
Look, look!

17:45.550 --> 17:46.410
Amazing, and there are more and more!

17:47.000 --> 17:47.680
Is that all?

17:48.240 --> 17:48.960
What's happening?

17:49.270 --> 17:49.890
Why did they disappear?

17:49.920 --> 17:50.580
Are there more?

17:50.790 --> 17:51.270
Yeah.

17:51.640 --> 17:52.000
Oh no.

17:52.310 --> 17:53.240
Ranran's spiritual power is insufficient.

17:57.960 --> 17:58.480
This is bad.

17:58.790 --> 17:59.720
I just used the Seeing Sunflower.

17:59.750 --> 18:00.790
The spiritual power consumption was too great.

18:18.060 --> 18:18.510
Look!

18:18.880 --> 18:19.820
It got bigger, bigger!

18:22.400 --> 18:22.790
It got bigger, bigger!

18:22.820 --> 18:23.680
It's even bigger!

18:25.550 --> 18:26.000
Look!

18:26.380 --> 18:27.140
It's amazing!

18:28.030 --> 18:28.720
So beautiful!

18:29.680 --> 18:30.720
So beautiful!

18:33.640 --> 18:34.160
I want one, I want one!

18:34.440 --> 18:35.550
-I want one.
-I want one.

18:36.400 --> 18:36.920
I want one too!

18:38.510 --> 18:39.270
There are peach blossoms!

18:50.310 --> 18:52.030
Don't fight, there's enough for everyone!

18:56.960 --> 18:57.640
I have some too!

18:58.070 --> 18:59.000
Look how many I have!

18:59.440 --> 19:00.310
Look, look at me!

19:01.000 --> 19:01.720
How many do you have?

19:03.680 --> 19:10.030
Amazing!

19:23.510 --> 19:24.030
Bottoms up!

19:24.030 --> 19:25.160
Come on, let's drink!

19:26.070 --> 19:26.590
Come on, come on!

19:26.790 --> 19:27.310
Ranran.

19:29.310 --> 19:29.970
Mr. Qin.

19:31.680 --> 19:32.880
What's the real reason behind

19:33.310 --> 19:34.200
asking me to host this banquet?

19:35.310 --> 19:36.960
Of course it's to mingle and investigate the case.

19:37.440 --> 19:38.110
Investigate?

19:40.000 --> 19:40.590
Come, come!

19:40.830 --> 19:41.550
Come, let's drink together!

19:42.510 --> 19:43.370
Well, do as you see fit.

19:43.400 --> 19:43.830
Pour him a drink!

19:44.200 --> 19:44.790
You drink with him.

19:46.030 --> 19:46.750
Come, come!

19:46.960 --> 19:47.400
Come on!

19:48.310 --> 19:49.070
Keep drinking!

19:51.810 --> 19:52.440
Master,

19:52.830 --> 19:53.590
I'll go over there first.

19:54.960 --> 19:55.870
Come on, bottoms up, bottoms up!

19:55.920 --> 19:56.880
Come on, drink, drink, drink!

19:59.590 --> 20:00.480
Gentlemen.

20:02.000 --> 20:02.700
Come on, come on!

20:03.090 --> 20:03.990
Alright, thank you.

20:04.680 --> 20:05.270
Let's play finger-guessing!

20:06.680 --> 20:07.210
Young lady,

20:07.390 --> 20:08.610
Drinking and playing finger-guessing now

20:08.640 --> 20:09.590
has become boring.

20:10.110 --> 20:11.550
We play cards while drinking now.

20:12.000 --> 20:12.640
Immortal Master cards.

20:16.030 --> 20:17.240
Immortal Kaiyuan?

20:17.550 --> 20:18.160
That's right.

20:18.850 --> 20:19.610
All the famous immortal masters

20:19.640 --> 20:21.270
are engraved on the back.

20:21.550 --> 20:22.590
Draw cards and compare their ranks.

20:22.750 --> 20:23.480
The loser drinks.

20:23.880 --> 20:25.480
We can bask in the aura of immortals

20:25.750 --> 20:26.820
and have fun at the same time.

20:27.440 --> 20:27.790
Come on.

20:27.820 --> 20:28.640
Let's play a round together.

20:28.660 --> 20:29.180
Let's play a round.

20:29.590 --> 20:30.030
Alright.

20:37.440 --> 20:39.750
Yan Liangyu, the senior disciple of Eternal Sect.

20:40.830 --> 20:42.480
I play the female Immortal Master of Hollow Sect,

20:42.510 --> 20:43.440
Wen Hongshan.

20:43.790 --> 20:44.590
It's higher than yours.

20:45.350 --> 20:47.310
Eternal Sect is the top Heavenly sect in the universe.

20:47.550 --> 20:48.880
And Yan Liangyu is the senior disciple.

20:49.070 --> 20:50.550
How can your Wen Hongshan be higher?

20:51.440 --> 20:53.880
Well, Immortal Master Yan has feelings for Immortal Master Wen.

20:54.070 --> 20:55.430
With love in his heart,

20:55.590 --> 20:56.960
he's naturally under her control.

20:58.030 --> 20:58.400
Well...

20:59.590 --> 21:00.240
That makes sense.

21:02.310 --> 21:03.670
I play the sovereign of Scud Sect,

21:03.880 --> 21:04.690
Lu Yun.

21:04.790 --> 21:05.790
A sect sovereign!

21:06.000 --> 21:07.110
There can't be anyone higher than him, right?

21:09.510 --> 21:11.310
Sovereign Su Yishui of the Wester Sect.

21:12.210 --> 21:13.580
Even the four major Heavenly sects can't match him.

21:14.510 --> 21:16.000
My card is the highest.

21:16.680 --> 21:17.360
You all

21:17.400 --> 21:18.590
better get ready to drink.

21:19.350 --> 21:20.790
You just got lucky.

21:20.810 --> 21:22.200
You even managed to draw

21:22.220 --> 21:23.180
a monster card like Su Yishui.

21:24.170 --> 21:24.650
Young lady.

21:24.680 --> 21:25.310
It's your turn.

21:25.750 --> 21:27.160
With Su Yishui already drawn,

21:27.180 --> 21:28.590
I guess you're not far from having to drink as punishment.

21:31.750 --> 21:32.640
I won, I won!

21:32.790 --> 21:33.830
The one I drew is

21:34.880 --> 21:36.480
Sovereign Su's master,

21:36.680 --> 21:37.510
Mu Qingge.

21:38.200 --> 21:38.720
Time to drink!

21:41.320 --> 21:41.970
Alright, alright.

21:42.000 --> 21:43.000
I'll drink, come on.

21:43.030 --> 21:43.510
Come on, come on!

21:43.510 --> 21:44.030
Alright, alright, let's go!

21:51.000 --> 21:53.440
I've heard there are many strange happenings at Wangxiang Pass.

21:53.790 --> 21:55.270
Has there been anything strange recently?

21:55.270 --> 21:55.960
Tell me about them.

21:57.480 --> 21:58.550
Speaking of strange things,

21:59.400 --> 22:01.350
isn't it our mean captain

22:01.790 --> 22:03.000
treating us all to drinks?

22:04.480 --> 22:05.070
Right.

22:05.400 --> 22:07.270
It's a pity those patrol brothers

22:07.600 --> 22:08.560
missed out on this

22:08.590 --> 22:10.070
once-in-a-century fun.

22:10.640 --> 22:11.680
Haven't seen him come back yet.

22:12.160 --> 22:13.440
Wonder what kind of tough assignment it is.

22:14.720 --> 22:15.920
Do those on patrol

22:16.440 --> 22:18.160
have anything in common?

22:18.480 --> 22:19.350
Not much,

22:19.830 --> 22:21.070
but those who go on patrol

22:21.270 --> 22:22.400
all come from the Elite Armored Guard.

22:25.070 --> 22:25.680
Come on.

22:27.870 --> 22:29.480
Young lady, you're really good

22:29.510 --> 22:30.200
at cards.

22:30.440 --> 22:31.830
Winning every round

22:31.880 --> 22:32.830
is so boring.

22:33.510 --> 22:34.110
Besides,

22:34.440 --> 22:36.310
you're so pretty.

22:36.480 --> 22:38.070
Why don't you drink

22:38.240 --> 22:39.270
with us two?

22:39.290 --> 22:40.340
That's right.

22:43.000 --> 22:43.880
The rule at the table is

22:44.030 --> 22:44.960
you drink when you lose.

22:45.990 --> 22:47.030
Won't drink with us?

22:47.510 --> 22:48.370
If you won't,

22:48.400 --> 22:51.240
then you'll have to keep us company with your smile.

22:57.160 --> 22:57.880
Gentlemen,

22:58.350 --> 23:00.030
have you had too much to drink and fallen?

23:00.660 --> 23:02.010
Put away your swords first.

23:02.310 --> 23:02.880
How about this?

23:03.070 --> 23:04.000
I'll toast you both a bowl of wine.

23:14.750 --> 23:15.760
Have you forgotten that after you drink,

23:15.790 --> 23:16.640
plants will grow wildly?

23:17.790 --> 23:18.790
One bowl won't hurt.

23:19.030 --> 23:19.830
We need to investigate the case after all.

23:24.750 --> 23:25.440
Master,

23:25.750 --> 23:26.480
your alcohol tolerance...

23:26.920 --> 23:27.480
I'm fine.

23:28.310 --> 23:28.960
A great drinker!

23:29.480 --> 23:29.920
Goodbye.

23:35.430 --> 23:36.740
Did Master

23:38.200 --> 23:39.270
drink on my behalf?

23:49.750 --> 23:50.710
As soon as the Spirit Spring stirred,

23:51.110 --> 23:52.840
you, Su Yishui, indeed eagerly

23:52.860 --> 23:54.220
rushed to Wangxiang Pass.

23:54.680 --> 23:55.440
It seems

23:55.480 --> 23:56.550
I don't need to work hard.

23:57.030 --> 23:59.200
Waiting to reap the benefits is enough.

24:08.310 --> 24:09.190
Mr. Qin.

24:10.590 --> 24:11.840
We don't keep outsiders in the military camp.

24:12.400 --> 24:13.680
Follow me to stay at an inn.

24:15.000 --> 24:15.550
But

24:15.810 --> 24:17.400
Master hasn't woken up yet.

24:19.590 --> 24:20.680
Don't look at me.

24:21.170 --> 24:22.170
He's your master.

24:22.200 --> 24:23.030
I don't care.

24:28.400 --> 24:29.440
I'm sorry, Master.

24:30.510 --> 24:30.960
Get up.

24:35.180 --> 24:35.750
Okay.

24:38.420 --> 24:40.140
Su Yishui, Su Yishui.

24:41.000 --> 24:42.350
You deserve this.

24:46.270 --> 24:46.680
Ranran.

24:47.830 --> 24:48.400
Ranran.

24:48.790 --> 24:49.790
If Master finds out

24:49.820 --> 24:50.790
after he wakes up,

24:51.110 --> 24:52.310
you're definitely in for it.

24:56.150 --> 24:58.780
[Madam Wu's Inn]

24:58.070 --> 24:58.830
Godmother.

25:00.840 --> 25:01.400
Godmother.

25:02.550 --> 25:05.280
[Owner: Madam Wu]

25:02.680 --> 25:03.510
Xuanjiu,

25:04.140 --> 25:04.950
are you

25:05.030 --> 25:06.270
bringing friends to stay at the inn?

25:07.880 --> 25:08.750
A friend who gets drunk after one cup.

25:10.960 --> 25:12.240
This is the inn run by my godmother.

25:12.510 --> 25:13.200
You can stay here.

25:13.550 --> 25:14.270
Put it on my tab.

25:14.720 --> 25:16.200
When your Master came down the mountain,

25:16.350 --> 25:17.680
he was in such a hurry, as if fleeing from the plague.

25:17.960 --> 25:18.680
It's possible

25:18.920 --> 25:19.960
he didn't even bring money.

25:20.430 --> 25:21.910
Master was in a great hurry to come down the mountain?

25:22.310 --> 25:22.880
Yes,

25:23.240 --> 25:24.430
he was in such a rush, as if he was on fire.

25:27.590 --> 25:28.980
Since you're Xuanjiu's friends,

25:29.350 --> 25:30.640
you're like family.

25:31.400 --> 25:32.270
Please make yourselves at home.

25:32.720 --> 25:33.240
Please, come in.

25:34.550 --> 25:35.000
Let's go.

25:38.880 --> 25:41.680
Mr. Qin said you were in a hurry to come down the mountain.

25:42.200 --> 25:42.920
Why?

25:44.440 --> 25:45.520
Could it be that you really knew

25:45.550 --> 25:46.310
about my feelings

25:46.790 --> 25:48.310
and rushed down to avoid me?

26:10.160 --> 26:10.960
He avoids me

26:11.830 --> 26:13.160
but can't help being nice to me.

26:16.570 --> 26:17.680
I must find a way

26:18.050 --> 26:19.660
to see through Master.

26:25.350 --> 26:25.880
Master,

26:26.350 --> 26:27.030
you're awake?

26:36.980 --> 26:38.020
After a year of cultivation,

26:38.720 --> 26:39.880
you've made quite some progress.

26:40.170 --> 26:41.650
You've learned to oppose me at every turn.

26:41.950 --> 26:43.210
Do you really think that I can't send you away

26:43.240 --> 26:44.400
because you have the Spirit Dispelling Charm?

26:44.640 --> 26:45.410
Master,

26:45.830 --> 26:46.790
I didn't intentionally

26:46.790 --> 26:48.000
step into that formation.

26:48.330 --> 26:49.740
I didn't mean to make you angry.

26:49.960 --> 26:51.920
I'm also investigating the mysterious case at Wangxiang Pass.

26:52.400 --> 26:54.200
If I give up halfway like this

26:54.960 --> 26:55.920
an can't accumulate virtue,

26:56.270 --> 26:57.400
it would be a shame.

27:04.030 --> 27:04.550
Master,

27:04.790 --> 27:05.350
I specially

27:05.350 --> 27:06.440
made some delicious food for you.

27:06.640 --> 27:07.200
Please try it

27:07.440 --> 27:08.030
and calm down.

27:10.550 --> 27:11.510
Please taste it, Master.

27:17.110 --> 27:17.880
Xue Ranran.

27:23.400 --> 27:23.960
It's delicious, isn't it?

27:24.440 --> 27:26.050
This is my newly developed almond crackers.

27:26.360 --> 27:27.560
It's all based on

27:27.590 --> 27:28.240
your taste preferences.

27:28.750 --> 27:30.480
Whichever dish you took an extra bite of,

27:30.680 --> 27:32.200
whichever soup you had an extra spoonful of,

27:32.310 --> 27:33.000
I remembered it all.

27:33.350 --> 27:34.400
It must suit your palate.

27:35.110 --> 27:36.110
So, Master,

27:36.240 --> 27:37.830
considering how much effort I've put into this,

27:38.310 --> 27:39.510
please let me stay.

27:42.520 --> 27:43.760
You're only allowed to stay until the Spirit Dispelling Formation

27:43.790 --> 27:44.960
loses its power.

27:45.750 --> 27:46.550
Thank you, Master.

27:49.950 --> 27:50.580
Master,

27:51.270 --> 27:52.790
there's one thing I don't understand.

27:53.310 --> 27:55.350
Why did that Earth Immortal know me?

27:55.830 --> 27:56.880
Is it

27:57.160 --> 27:58.310
related to my past life?

27:59.510 --> 28:00.640
Since you've already said it's about your past life,

28:01.030 --> 28:01.720
why ask more?

28:06.240 --> 28:08.030
But when I entered the small vine,

28:08.640 --> 28:09.920
in my memories,

28:10.840 --> 28:11.710
I saw

28:13.000 --> 28:14.400
that the vine master wanted to kill me.

28:16.440 --> 28:17.030
Your memories

28:17.050 --> 28:18.140
are indeed starting to recover.

28:20.200 --> 28:20.920
Master,

28:21.320 --> 28:23.690
was I a bad person in my past life?

28:23.720 --> 28:24.160
No.

28:26.810 --> 28:27.590
You were very good.

28:28.240 --> 28:28.830
How good?

28:30.240 --> 28:31.350
I've said there's no need to ask again.

28:31.920 --> 28:32.830
Perhaps you want to settle

28:32.850 --> 28:33.800
the score for your disrespect today

28:33.930 --> 28:34.520
all at once

28:34.680 --> 28:35.310
and punish you properly?

28:37.400 --> 28:38.550
Fine, I won't ask.

28:38.960 --> 28:40.110
Anyway, you can't hit me

28:40.270 --> 28:41.160
with your ruler.

28:46.550 --> 28:47.200
Mr. Qin.

28:48.640 --> 28:49.440
You get drunk quickly

28:49.750 --> 28:50.640
but sober up slowly.

28:52.240 --> 28:53.070
Have you found anything?

28:53.920 --> 28:55.680
May I ask if your cat

28:56.030 --> 28:57.270
has injured one of its paws?

28:58.960 --> 28:59.960
How do you know that?

29:01.550 --> 29:03.150
You have three long and

29:03.400 --> 29:04.310
one short scratch marks.

29:04.640 --> 29:05.960
It must be from a cat with an injured paw.

29:06.270 --> 29:07.650
I just saw that quite a few people

29:07.680 --> 29:08.280
in the camp

29:08.310 --> 29:09.200
have similar scratch marks.

29:10.890 --> 29:11.650
In my camp,

29:11.680 --> 29:12.480
there's only one cat.

29:13.070 --> 29:14.200
When everyone plays with it,

29:14.330 --> 29:15.060
they get scratched.

29:15.270 --> 29:16.280
What's so strange about that?

29:16.680 --> 29:17.350
The scratch marks

29:17.350 --> 29:18.720
on those dead soldiers,

29:19.030 --> 29:20.110
though larger in size,

29:20.440 --> 29:21.640
are also three long and one short.

29:22.310 --> 29:23.550
If that monster

29:24.000 --> 29:25.070
also has an injured paw,

29:25.440 --> 29:26.350
it would be too much of a coincidence.

29:26.880 --> 29:28.360
Combined with the merging of demonic aura,

29:28.640 --> 29:29.550
we can deduce that

29:29.830 --> 29:30.830
your cat

29:31.200 --> 29:31.920
is most likely a demon.

29:32.000 --> 29:32.470
It can't be.

29:32.880 --> 29:34.160
I've raised Coal for so many years.

29:34.350 --> 29:35.000
It wouldn't harm anyone.

29:35.400 --> 29:36.720
The disappearance of soldiers in the camp

29:37.200 --> 29:38.270
has only happened in the past six months.

29:39.000 --> 29:40.030
If Coal were a demon,

29:40.920 --> 29:42.110
why didn't it act earlier?

29:42.550 --> 29:43.550
Even if we take a step back,

29:43.830 --> 29:44.590
if it wanted to harm people,

29:44.920 --> 29:46.110
there are so many people in my camp.

29:46.830 --> 29:48.200
Why would it specifically go to the riverside?

29:53.870 --> 29:54.910
Becoming a demon

29:55.550 --> 29:56.400
and harming people are not the same thing.

29:58.030 --> 29:58.590
You're right.

29:59.270 --> 30:01.130
Becoming a demon and harming people are not the same thing.

30:01.510 --> 30:02.830
The cat being a demon is certain,

30:03.110 --> 30:04.160
but whether it will harm people

30:04.360 --> 30:05.360
is another matter to consider.

30:05.830 --> 30:06.640
Thank you, Master.

30:08.550 --> 30:09.160
Mr. Qin,

30:10.920 --> 30:12.160
take this demon-revealing talisman.

30:12.550 --> 30:13.790
When you see the cat, stick it on it.

30:14.070 --> 30:14.820
Whether it's a demon or not

30:14.920 --> 30:15.590
will be immediately clear.

30:17.440 --> 30:18.850
If it's all for nothing,

30:19.310 --> 30:20.720
you don't need to concern yourselves

30:21.590 --> 30:22.550
with the affairs in my camp tomorrow.

30:28.160 --> 30:28.550
Ranran,

30:28.920 --> 30:30.320
you just said that harming people and becoming a demon

30:30.350 --> 30:31.110
are not the same thing.

30:31.310 --> 30:32.030
Then what about harming people?

30:32.200 --> 30:32.960
How do we investigate that?

30:33.360 --> 30:34.230
During my performance,

30:34.350 --> 30:35.680
I used the conjured peach blossom petals

30:35.880 --> 30:36.690
to place a Spirit-tracking Spell

30:36.720 --> 30:38.000
on every soldier in the camp.

30:38.200 --> 30:39.350
Whether the culprit is the cat or not,

30:39.790 --> 30:41.000
if it likes to control people

30:41.000 --> 30:41.920
to kill them by the river,

30:42.330 --> 30:44.040
then once a soldier falls under its spell,

30:44.640 --> 30:45.480
this tree branch

30:45.680 --> 30:46.830
will help us go there

30:47.030 --> 30:47.590
and catch it.

30:52.200 --> 30:53.270
Master, where are you going?

30:53.290 --> 30:54.220
Just focus on investigating your case.

31:04.550 --> 31:05.720
There's a faint trace of resentment.

31:06.830 --> 31:07.480
I couldn't sense it

31:07.500 --> 31:08.500
without approaching the riverside.

31:10.060 --> 31:11.650
The compass was damaged by demonic aura.

31:12.440 --> 31:13.720
But there's resentment in this river.

31:15.400 --> 31:16.230
Maybe I can find something

31:16.440 --> 31:17.480
by investigating the resentment.

31:37.000 --> 31:37.550
Coal.

31:38.400 --> 31:39.400
I'll give it a try.

31:39.920 --> 31:41.350
It's also to shut others up.

31:55.350 --> 31:56.200
I knew it.

31:57.480 --> 31:58.830
How could Coal possibly be a demon?

32:10.760 --> 32:12.710
[Madam Wu's Inn]

32:13.070 --> 32:14.030
Su Yishui!

32:15.590 --> 32:16.350
Su Yishui!

32:20.920 --> 32:21.680
Su Yishui!

32:24.200 --> 32:24.750
Mr. Qin?

32:25.640 --> 32:26.400
Where's Su Yishui?

32:26.970 --> 32:28.230
Master went out last night.

32:28.310 --> 32:29.480
Mr. Qin, what's the urgent matter?

32:30.070 --> 32:30.550
I...

32:32.790 --> 32:33.440
Mr. Qin,

32:33.880 --> 32:35.510
did the black cat touch the demon-detecting talisman?

32:37.830 --> 32:39.240
It turned into a huge creature.

32:40.830 --> 32:41.680
But it didn't hurt anyone.

32:42.030 --> 32:43.110
Coal didn't hurt anyone.

32:43.350 --> 32:44.110
Mr. Qin,

32:44.450 --> 32:45.520
it has revealed its true form.

32:45.550 --> 32:46.900
How can you still say it won't hurt anyone?

32:46.960 --> 32:48.030
If I say it won't, then it won't.

32:48.590 --> 32:49.000
I—

32:49.070 --> 32:49.830
Xuanjiu.

32:50.880 --> 32:51.550
It's so early in the morning.

32:51.550 --> 32:52.590
What are you shouting about?

32:52.830 --> 32:53.480
Godmother,

32:54.480 --> 32:55.440
I got anxious.

32:56.030 --> 32:57.790
Don't argue with your friends.

32:58.240 --> 32:59.070
Come down,

32:59.310 --> 33:00.440
it's time for breakfast.

33:03.920 --> 33:04.790
Let's eat and talk.

33:11.030 --> 33:11.720
Come on...

33:12.410 --> 33:12.970
If you were any later,

33:13.000 --> 33:13.920
you wouldn't get any.

33:14.030 --> 33:15.440
This is the last batch for today.

33:16.030 --> 33:17.030
Lucky you.

33:18.790 --> 33:19.920
The buns made by my godmother

33:19.940 --> 33:21.070
are the best in Wangxiang Pass.

33:21.200 --> 33:22.110
My bros and I

33:22.240 --> 33:22.920
often come for the buns.

33:23.590 --> 33:24.830
Stop bragging about this for me.

33:25.110 --> 33:26.070
Enjoy your meal.

33:40.400 --> 33:41.030
Ranran,

33:41.590 --> 33:42.480
you can have the porridge.

33:42.720 --> 33:44.590
I'll ask my godmother to make some more tomorrow.

33:45.240 --> 33:45.800
Mr. Qin,

33:46.240 --> 33:47.160
may I ask

33:47.270 --> 33:48.920
why you made Madam Wu your godmother?

33:50.400 --> 33:51.070
Madam Wu

33:51.440 --> 33:52.200
is the mother

33:52.200 --> 33:53.480
of my comrade.

33:54.160 --> 33:55.640
Unfortunately, he died during patrol

33:55.750 --> 33:56.640
and can't come back.

33:58.310 --> 33:59.480
Since I've also lost my mom,

34:00.200 --> 34:01.070
it's not bad to have

34:01.920 --> 34:02.480
a godmother.

34:05.030 --> 34:05.550
Ranran,

34:06.590 --> 34:07.790
does your demon-revelation talisman

34:08.510 --> 34:09.110
really work?

34:10.000 --> 34:11.070
Could it be malfunctioning?

34:11.400 --> 34:12.070
No way.

34:12.630 --> 34:13.670
But it might not be what killed

34:13.840 --> 34:14.550
the soldiers.

34:15.000 --> 34:15.480
Really?

34:16.030 --> 34:17.800
The black cat was sleeping peacefully in Mr. Qin's room,

34:18.110 --> 34:19.710
but the Spirit-tracking Spell showed no response.

34:19.880 --> 34:20.880
This indicates that nothing happened.

34:21.630 --> 34:22.110
Moreover,

34:22.590 --> 34:24.120
those forced to reveal their true forms by that talisman

34:24.320 --> 34:25.320
will surely run wild

34:25.440 --> 34:26.280
and unleash their beastly nature.

34:26.940 --> 34:28.380
But right in front of Mr. Qin,

34:28.889 --> 34:30.530
the black cat just ran away.

34:31.150 --> 34:32.469
It means it suppressed its animal nature.

34:32.710 --> 34:33.670
It doesn't seem like a harmful monster.

34:34.760 --> 34:35.760
So none of those possibilities

34:36.320 --> 34:37.280
make sense.

34:37.550 --> 34:38.280
What now?

34:39.710 --> 34:40.590
Just wait without doing anything?

34:41.920 --> 34:42.880
We just need to wait.

34:43.770 --> 34:45.510
Wait until someone else in the camp is bewitched.

34:45.880 --> 34:47.230
It will surely activate my Spirit-tracking Spell.

34:47.630 --> 34:48.320
Then

34:48.480 --> 34:49.670
everything will become clear.

35:03.400 --> 35:04.070
Something's wrong.

35:04.840 --> 35:06.190
Another soldier in the camp has been bewitched

35:06.190 --> 35:06.800
and left the camp.

35:07.110 --> 35:08.070
Follow the Peach Blossom

35:08.280 --> 35:08.880
and we'll definitely find

35:08.880 --> 35:09.840
that evil demon.

35:10.000 --> 35:10.440
But

35:10.760 --> 35:12.000
Master hasn't returned yet.

35:12.110 --> 35:13.230
How can we wait for

35:13.320 --> 35:14.070
such an urgent matter?

35:18.000 --> 35:18.670
It's alright.

35:19.230 --> 35:20.230
It's definitely not Coal.

35:28.510 --> 35:29.920
There's the soldier who has been bewitched.

35:30.070 --> 35:31.230
The evil demon is nearby.

35:31.840 --> 35:32.920
Once it appears,

35:33.320 --> 35:34.800
we'll form the Four Qi Condensation Formation,

35:35.400 --> 35:36.150
and I'll be the formation's core.

35:40.190 --> 35:40.630
Wake up.

35:54.600 --> 35:55.450
Do you hear

35:55.480 --> 35:56.280
a strange sound?

35:56.800 --> 35:57.630
What sound?

35:58.280 --> 35:59.230
You don't hear that?

35:59.710 --> 36:00.370
It's like

36:00.800 --> 36:01.920
the sound of a river flowing by my ears,

36:02.400 --> 36:03.320
and it's very close.

36:04.550 --> 36:05.840
Try covering your ears.

36:07.400 --> 36:07.950
It doesn't work.

36:08.320 --> 36:09.000
It sounds like

36:09.840 --> 36:11.320
it's coming out of my head.

36:20.190 --> 36:20.710
Form the formation.

36:22.670 --> 36:23.270
No, wait.

36:24.630 --> 36:25.450
Xue Ranran,

36:25.670 --> 36:26.360
form the formation.

36:27.000 --> 36:28.000
If the cat demon wanted to kill,

36:28.510 --> 36:29.360
it wouldn't need to come to the riverside.

36:29.570 --> 36:30.300
Something's not right.

36:30.320 --> 36:30.800
You...

36:38.530 --> 36:40.120
Transform Kun into Qian and exchange Kan for Li.

36:40.150 --> 36:41.060
I'll be the formation's core.

37:25.150 --> 37:26.280
This is Master's spiritual power.

37:26.920 --> 37:27.800
This branch

37:28.070 --> 37:29.320
will help us get there

37:29.340 --> 37:29.900
and catch it.

37:32.090 --> 37:34.010
Master added immortal power to protect us.

37:41.590 --> 37:42.150
The resentment

37:42.880 --> 37:43.880
went to Ranran.

37:44.880 --> 37:45.550
Xi'er.

38:06.880 --> 38:07.320
This is bad.

38:09.590 --> 38:10.450
If I protect myself,

38:10.550 --> 38:11.440
I won't be able to save them.

38:18.280 --> 38:19.070
One wisp of qi

38:22.430 --> 38:23.540
to break the galaxy!

38:39.400 --> 38:41.000
One Wisp of Qi to Break the Galaxy.

38:42.170 --> 38:44.170
Someone just used the "One Wisp of Qi to Break the Galaxy"

38:44.230 --> 38:45.280
to extract my spiritual power

38:45.300 --> 38:46.860
along with the Soul-Devouring Lock.

38:48.670 --> 38:50.240
She's really still alive.

38:52.030 --> 38:53.030
Qingge...

38:54.920 --> 38:56.840
You just won't leave me alone.

38:59.230 --> 39:00.840
Everything in this life

39:01.910 --> 39:03.350
must be mine.

39:12.670 --> 39:13.440
Are you hurt?

39:15.000 --> 39:16.120
I'm just a bit weak.

39:16.480 --> 39:17.030
It's nothing.

39:23.510 --> 39:24.280
This technique...

39:25.110 --> 39:26.190
you learned it from the Vine's consciousness,

39:26.190 --> 39:26.760
didn't you?

39:28.630 --> 39:29.710
You'll gradually remember

39:30.330 --> 39:31.640
everything from the past, right?

39:32.590 --> 39:33.230
Don't use

39:33.550 --> 39:34.320
this technique again in the future.

39:35.850 --> 39:36.850
Isn't it a technique

39:36.880 --> 39:37.630
I used in my past life?

39:38.320 --> 39:39.190
All magical techniques

39:39.480 --> 39:40.550
depend on the practitioner.

39:41.030 --> 39:42.150
Your current cultivation is not enough.

39:42.600 --> 39:43.640
Using this technique that borrows external power

39:43.670 --> 39:44.480
will harm you.

39:44.960 --> 39:45.710
External power?

39:46.190 --> 39:47.760
Where did I borrow external power from?

39:48.400 --> 39:49.290
You only need to know

39:49.320 --> 39:50.320
that before forming your Golden Core,

39:50.340 --> 39:51.340
you're not allowed to use it again.

39:51.880 --> 39:52.460
Also,

39:53.280 --> 39:54.510
don't mention anything you saw

39:54.800 --> 39:55.840
in the Vine to others.

39:56.960 --> 39:57.510
Understood.

40:05.480 --> 40:06.480
What just happened?

40:06.880 --> 40:08.030
Where did all those fish go?

40:08.440 --> 40:09.720
The fish demon was injured and fled.

40:10.510 --> 40:11.360
Master.

40:12.000 --> 40:13.710
It was a half-human, half-fish demon

40:13.900 --> 40:14.900
controlling the school of fish.

40:15.290 --> 40:17.020
Demons are bound by the laws of nature.

40:17.110 --> 40:18.320
They can never transform into human form.

40:18.770 --> 40:19.330
How could there be

40:19.360 --> 40:20.630
a half-human, half-fish creature?

40:20.880 --> 40:21.360
Ranran,

40:21.800 --> 40:23.000
you must have seen it wrong.

40:23.450 --> 40:24.200
I saw it clearly

40:24.230 --> 40:25.320
when I fought it.

40:25.710 --> 40:26.590
I couldn't be mistaken.

40:28.230 --> 40:28.880
Moreover...

40:34.260 --> 40:35.100
It's human blood.

40:35.630 --> 40:36.710
This doesn't make sense.

40:44.630 --> 40:45.360
Resentment?

40:48.280 --> 40:48.840
That's right.

40:49.630 --> 40:51.280
What's on that fish monster isn't demonic aura,

40:51.400 --> 40:52.230
but resentment.

40:53.710 --> 40:54.840
At least we were right about one thing.

40:55.480 --> 40:56.400
The fish demon harmed people,

40:56.670 --> 40:57.710
while the cat demon was saving people.

40:59.070 --> 40:59.840
That cat demon

41:00.280 --> 41:01.880
did indeed shield us from a calamity.

41:02.920 --> 41:03.760
The cat demon had already discovered

41:03.760 --> 41:05.030
the truth about the fish demon harming people long ago.

41:05.630 --> 41:06.880
Each time it rushed to the riverside,

41:06.900 --> 41:07.710
it was trying to wake up

41:07.710 --> 41:08.960
the soldiers under control.

41:09.670 --> 41:10.960
That's why there were

41:10.960 --> 41:11.800
scratch marks left on the deceased.

41:13.070 --> 41:14.710
Then the strange bell sound we heard—

41:15.000 --> 41:16.070
was it the fish demon's evil technique?

41:26.440 --> 41:27.280
It was also resentment.

41:28.000 --> 41:29.840
When did we also get affected by the resentment?

41:31.840 --> 41:33.000
How come Ranran is fine?

41:34.880 --> 41:36.440
We've always been together.

41:37.360 --> 41:38.710
The only difference is...

41:41.670 --> 41:42.360
The steamed buns.

41:43.070 --> 41:43.800
It's the steamed buns.

41:44.800 --> 41:45.710
Mr. Qin said

41:45.820 --> 41:47.250
the soldiers in the camp also loved eating steamed buns.

41:47.800 --> 41:48.360
If the resentment

41:48.360 --> 41:49.710
was infused into the buns before they were eaten,

41:50.190 --> 41:51.190
strange water sounds

41:51.190 --> 41:52.150
would ring in their ears,

41:52.360 --> 41:53.480
controlling them to walk to the riverside.

41:54.510 --> 41:56.030
If there's something wrong with those buns,

41:56.590 --> 41:57.320
then wouldn't that mean...

41:58.000 --> 41:59.000
Let's wake up the soldier

41:59.030 --> 41:59.710
and ask him first.

42:02.090 --> 42:03.150
-Wake up!
-Wake up!

42:03.830 --> 42:04.830
Half-human, half-fish...

42:05.280 --> 42:06.000
Resentment...

42:07.280 --> 42:08.510
It must have something to do with the Spirit Spring.

42:09.400 --> 42:10.840
But how did it manage to do this?

42:12.150 --> 42:13.360
It's you, the immortal masters.

42:14.760 --> 42:15.710
Thank you for saving my life, immortal masters!

42:16.030 --> 42:16.800
It's our duty.

42:17.360 --> 42:17.920
Let me ask you,

42:18.330 --> 42:19.120
have you eaten

42:19.150 --> 42:20.030
Madam Wu's steamed buns recently?

42:20.590 --> 42:21.190
Yes, I have.

42:22.840 --> 42:23.670
In the past few days,

42:23.760 --> 42:24.920
what connection do you have

42:24.940 --> 42:25.820
with those missing Elite Armored Guards?

42:27.110 --> 42:27.760
Five years ago,

42:28.010 --> 42:28.520
we all served

42:28.550 --> 42:29.580
in a small border patrol unit

42:30.590 --> 42:31.440
for half a month.

42:32.110 --> 42:32.880
In that unit,

42:33.320 --> 42:33.880
besides you,

42:34.280 --> 42:35.150
how many are still alive?

42:35.710 --> 42:36.510
There's one more...

42:38.110 --> 42:38.710
Captain Qin.
